  (text "24 R + 51 R = 75 R termination; the divider scales the signal by 0.68\nand the 100 nF AC-couples it into AIN1. Values from the Antmicro reference.\nFit an RCA or Fakra jack instead if preferred. AIN2..AIN6 are free for\nmore cameras: copy this network (select the input over I2C)."
    (at 17.78 137.16 0)
