  )
  (text "DRAFT - check against the ADI ADV7282-M datasheet before layout.\nCircuit after Antmicro cvbs-mipi-bridge (Apache-2.0):\n  github.com/antmicro/cvbs-mipi-bridge\n\nRaspberry Pi: dtoverlay=adv7282m (I2C 0x21 on the CSI/DSI bus,\n  CAM1, 1 lane). Capture is V4L2 (/dev/video0), not libcamera.\n  The overlay targets Unicam: CM4 only, untested on CM5.\n"
    (at 167.64 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6ac0954c-ae64-50b4-9879-7c98a815386e")
  )
  (text "I2C is mandatory: the chip starts with its CSI-2 output off and\n  the driver configures it. Shares RPI_SDA/RPI_SCL with the MFi\n  chip; no address clash (0x10 vs 0x21/0x42/0x44).\n\nNo CM GPIO used: PWRDWN and RESET come from RC delays.\nSupplies: 1.8 V LDO from +3V3_M2, one 220 R bead per 1.8 V rail.\n\nCamera power (+12 V from the reversing light) is not on this\n  sheet. A short to +12 V on the video line would destroy D7:\n  add series protection if the camera wiring is not trusted."
    (at 284.48 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "c9f6c3dc-404c-56f5-8c02-87943f00150a")
  )
